# 🌦️ Smart Solar Weather Station

An IoT-based smart weather station built using ESP8266/ESP32 and multiple environmental sensors.  
The system monitors real-time weather conditions, air quality, and power consumption while displaying live data on an OLED screen and uploading readings to the cloud for remote monitoring.

---

# 🚀 Features

- 🌡️ Real-time temperature monitoring
- 💧 Humidity sensing
- 🌪️ Atmospheric pressure monitoring
- 🫧 Air quality and gas detection using MQ-2
- 🔋 Battery voltage/current monitoring using INA219
- 📺 Live OLED display output
- ☁️ Cloud integration using ThingSpeak
- 🌞 Solar-powered charging system
- 🔋 18650 battery backup
- 👋 IR wave-to-wake display system
- 🖨️ Custom 3D printed enclosure
- 📡 WiFi-enabled remote monitoring

---

