# 📺 System Functionality

The weather station continuously collects environmental and electrical data from connected sensors.

### Data Collected
- Temperature
- Humidity
- Pressure
- Air Quality
- Battery Voltage
- Current Consumption
- Power Usage
- WiFi Signal Strength

The collected data is:

1. Displayed live on an OLED screen  
2. Uploaded to the cloud every 30 seconds  
3. Accessible remotely through a web dashboard  

