# 🔌 Pin Configuration

| NodeMCU Pin | Connected Device |
|---|---|
| D1 (GPIO5) | SCL (BME280, INA219, OLED) |
| D2 (GPIO4) | SDA (BME280, INA219, OLED) |
| A0 | MQ-2 Analog Output |
| D6 (GPIO12) | IR Sensor |
| VIN | 5V Input |
| 3V3 | Sensor Power |
| GND | Common Ground |

---

# ⚡ Power System

The station uses a solar-powered battery charging system.

### Power Flow
Solar Panel → TP4056 Charger → 18650 Battery → Step-Up Converter → ESP8266 System

### Advantages
- Portable
- Energy efficient
- Renewable energy powered
- Outdoor deployment ready

